1. An apparatus comprising:  
a work base configured to circulate a plurality of workpieces among a plurality of work areas at fixed time intervals;  
an internal robot positioned within a circulation path of the workpieces and configured to reach at least two of the plurality of work areas;  
an external robot positioned outside the circulation path and configured to reach at least one of the plurality of work areas; and  
a controller configured to coordinate operation of the internal robot and the external robot to perform respective operations on the workpieces in synchronization with circulation of the workpieces by the work base.
